    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d12">

                <pb facs="0321" n="7" sameAs="frus:frus1914Supp/pg7"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 711.0012/515</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Sweden</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Morris</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Stockholm</hi></placeName>, <date
                        ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" calendar="gregorian"
                        notAfter="1914-09-22T23:00:00-05:00" notBefore="1914-09-22T00:00:00+02:00"
                            ><hi rendition="#italic">undated</hi></date>. <lb/> [<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Received September 22, 1914, 11 p.m.</hi>] </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>Just had meeting with Foreign Minister and am delighted to inform you that
                    Swedish Government has now agreed to peace treaty in form you desire and will
                    instruct Minister at Washington to sign <pb facs="0322" n="8" xml:id="pg8"/> at
                    same time that treaties with England and France are signed as suggested in your
                    telegram September 8.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d12-f1"/> Foreign Minister said I
                    might cable this to you and that formal notification would come later. He handed
                    me copy of treaty which embodies what you desire, copy being sent by mail; if
                    you desire can telegraph text immediately.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Morris</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d12-f1" n="1" xml:id="d12-f1-content">
                <p>The treaty was signed on October 13. <ref target="frus1915#pg_1290">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1915, p. 1290</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
